# Keep LF in the working tree on every platform.
# These files are consumed by bash (`source pipeline/.env`), Docker's env_file
# parser and dbt — all of which break on CRLF, and all of which fail with errors
# that look like authentication or connection problems rather than line endings.
# Without this, Git for Windows' default core.autocrlf=true rewrites them on checkout.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png  binary
*.pbix binary
